# This repository ships exactly what is named below, and nothing else.
#
# A denylist was tried first and failed its own dry run: it let figures/*.tex,
# a 3.8 MB database dump and a stray .tmp file through.  So: ignore everything
# first, then un-ignore the submission.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!filmbench.cpp
!filmdb-load.sql
!project1.pdf
!report.pdf
!figures/
figures/*
!figures/chart-scoreboard.png
!figures/pipeline.png
!figures/chart-twoclocks.png
